    "FX5-4AD-ADP – 4 AI, ±10 V / ±20 mA (0–10 V, 4–20 mA), 14 bit, adaptér na levý bok CPU": "FX5-4AD-ADP – 4 AI，±10 V / ±20 mA（0–10 V，4–20 mA），14 bit，CPU 左侧适配器",
