    "Sablona: analogovy vstup se skalovanim a mezemi. rawMax uprav dle platformy: Siemens 27648, Beckhoff 32767, Mitsubishi FX5 16000, Rockwell dle modulu.": "模板：带标定和限值的模拟量输入。rawMax 按平台调整：Siemens 27648，Beckhoff 32767，Mitsubishi FX5 16000，Rockwell 视模块而定。",
    "Sablona: analogovy vystup — inzenyrske jednotky -> surova hodnota": "模板：模拟量输出 — 工程单位 -> 原始值",
    "Sablona: dvoupolohovy ventil/valec s koncovymi snimaci. Porucha (timeout prestaveni, ztrata polohy otevreno) drzi do kvitace (reset).": "Template: two-position valve/cylinder with limit switches. Fault (travel timeout, loss of open position) is latched until acknowledged (reset).",
    "Sablona: frekvencni menic pres I/O - chod, smer, analogova zadana otacek s rampou v PLC. Porucha (vstup fault, menic nepripraven, otacky nedosazeny, ztrata hlaseni) drzi do kvitace (reset).": "Template: frequency inverter via I/O - run, direction, analog speed setpoint with ramp in PLC. Fault (fault input, inverter not ready, speed not reached, feedback lost) latches until acknowledged (reset).",
    "Sablona: motor/cerpadlo se zpetnym hlasenim behu. Porucha (timeout rozbehu, ztrata hlaseni, vstup fault) drzi do kvitace (reset).": "模板：带运行反馈的电机/泵。故障（启动超时、反馈丢失、fault 输入）保持到故障确认 (reset)。",
    "Sablona: polohovaci pohon se zaznamy pres I/O (Festo CMMO / CMMT, SMC JXC) - vyber zaznamu, start, v poloze. Porucha (vstup fault, pohon nepripraven, bez referovani, ztrata polohy, timeout) drzi do kvitace (reset).": "Template: positioning drive with records via I/O (Festo CMMO / CMMT, SMC JXC) - record selection, start, in position. Fault (fault input, drive not ready, not homed, position lost, timeout) latches until acknowledged (reset).",
    "Sablona: proporcionalni ventil tlaku / prutoku - analogova zadana s rampou v PLC, volitelne hlidani skutecne hodnoty. Porucha (odchylka nad toleranci po nastavenou dobu, zadana nedosazena do 5 s) drzi do kvitace (reset).": "Template: proportional valve for pressure / flow - analog setpoint with ramp in PLC, optional actual value monitoring. Fault (deviation above tolerance for the set time, setpoint not reached within 5 s) latches until acknowledged (reset).",
    "Sablona: servoosa - obalka nad bloky Motion Control platformy (zapnuti, referovani, polohovani, rychlost, zastaveni, rucni pojezd). Porucha osy, odmitnuty povel, bez referovani, regulace nezapnuta do 5 s drzi do kvitace (reset).": "模板：伺服轴 - 平台 Motion Control 功能块的封装（使能、回零、定位、速度、停止、手动点动）。轴故障、命令被拒绝、未回零、伺服使能未在 5 s 内接通均保持至故障确认 (reset)。",
    "Sada tlačítka nouzového zastavení s kontakty (např. 2 NC + samodiagnostika)": "急停按钮套件，带触点（例如 2 NC + 自诊断）",
